      "updated": 1791540000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Arrows point from the foreign key to its parent. Foreign keys are ON DELETE CASCADE unless marked SET NULL.\nforms.response_count, starts_count and completed_count are correlated COUNT column properties, not stored columns.\nA null target_question_id means the rule jumps to the thank-you screen. Uploaded files live on disk; answers store their URL.",
      "originalText": "Arrows point from the foreign key to its parent. Foreign keys are ON DELETE CASCADE unless marked SET NULL.\nforms.response_count, starts_count and completed_count are correlated COUNT column properties, not stored columns.\nA null target_question_id means the rule jumps to the thank-you screen. Uploaded files live on disk; answers store their URL.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
